    "text": "# Simple example input file for running CBS\n# Pat Scott May 2019\n\n#TP 19th Jul 2019 - just fiddled slightly with the original to take a hepmc file from\n#the ATLAS_0Lep analysis (generated in PYTHIA) which we are using to verify CBS.\n#Settings adjusted accordingly.\n\n#EDIT TP Jul 22nd - using input from GAMBIT to esnure consistency.generate\n\nanalyses:\n  - ATLAS_EXOT_2019_04\n  # - CMS_SUS_19_012\n\nsettings:\n  debug: true\n  seed: 1337\n  check_cutflow: true\n  check_histogram: true\n  processes:\n    - name: EWino\n      cross_section_fb: 37.38\n      cross_section_uncert_fb: 0.001\n      files:\n        - /Users/p.zhu/Workshop/GambitWS/ATLAS_EXOT_2019_04/Events/singleB_1200_10K_01.hepmc\n        - /Users/p.zhu/Workshop/GambitWS/ATLAS_EXOT_2019_04/Events/singleB_1200_10K_02.hepmc\n        - /Users/p.zhu/Workshop/GambitWS/ATLAS_EXOT_2019_04/Events/singleB_1200_10K_03.hepmc\n  # event_file: /Users/p.zhu/Workshop/GambitWS/ATLAS_EXOT_2019_04/Events/singletB_1200_50K.hepmc\n  # cross_section_fb: 37.38\n  # event_file: /Users/p.zhu/Workshop/GambitWS/ATLAS_EXOT_2019_04/Events/singletB_1600_50K.hepmc\n  # cross_section_fb: 22.705\n  # event_file: /Users/p.zhu/Workshop/GambitWS/ATLAS_EXOT_2019_04/Events/singletB_2000_50K.hepmc\n  # cross_section_fb: 17.564\n\n  # jet_collections, including VRTrackJets, are supplied by CBS_defaults.yaml\n  # for ATLAS_EXOT_2019_04. Add them here only to override the defaults.\n  output: ./runs/CBS_result.json\n  screen_output: true\n",
